---
import PageLayout from "../components/PageLayout.astro";
import CTA from "../components/CTA.astro";
import "../sass/pages/dj.scss";
---

<PageLayout
  title="DJ PAPI"
  subtitle="International DJ. 3+ Countries"
  description="DJ portfolio by Aayan Shaikh - When a dancer hijacks the DJ booth"
>
  <p>Latest Mix:</p>
  <div class="video-section">
    <iframe
      width="100%"
      height="120"
      src="https://player-widget.mixcloud.com/widget/iframe/?hide_cover=1&feed=%2Fdjaayan%2Fpapi-live-from-retro-mountain-koh-phangan-progressive-house%2F"
      frameborder="0"
      allow="encrypted-media; fullscreen; autoplay; idle-detection; speaker-selection; web-share;"
    ></iframe>

    <p>
      If you've ever wondered what happens when a dancer hijacks the DJ booth,
      wonder no more.
    </p>
    <a id="links" href="/dj-links">Presskit and useful links</a>

    <h2>My Genres</h2>
    <div class="genres-grid">
      <div class="genre-card">Progressive House</div>
      <div class="genre-card">Classic Retro</div>
      <div class="genre-card">Commercial / Hip Hop</div>
      <div class="genre-card">Disco / NuDisco</div>
      <div class="genre-card">Indie Dance</div>
      <div class="genre-card">Kizomba / Taraxxo</div>
      <div class="genre-card">Bachata</div>
      <div class="genre-card">Salsa</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Performance Highlights</h2>
      <div class="card highlight-card">
        <h3>Residencies</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>2026 (Ex-Resident) Kohmunity Hostel, Koh Phangan 🇹🇭</li>
          <li>2026 (Ex-Resident) Full Moon Radio, Koh Phangan 🇹🇭</li>
          <li>2026 (Ex-Resident) Elephant and Co</li>
          <li>2026 (Ex-Resident) Cafe Lilliput, Anjuna, Goa</li>
          <li>2025 (Ex-Resident) This is it, Arambol, Goa</li>
          <li>2025 (Ex-Resident) Club Cubana, Anjuna, Goa</li>
          <li>2025 (Ex-Resident) Wanderlust Hostel, Koh Phangan 🇹🇭</li>
          <li>2023 (Ex-Resident) Cobber and Crew (#2 Bar in India)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card highlight-card">
        <h3>International Shows</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Jungle Experience Festival, Koh Phangan 🇹🇭</li>
          <li>Retro Mountain, Koh Phangan 🇹🇭</li>
          <li>Guy's Bar, Koh Phangan 🇹🇭</li>
          <li>Seaside Sunset Bar, Koh Phangan 🇹🇭</li>
          <li>Latin Notion, Phuket 🇹🇭</li>
          <li>Full Moon Radio, Koh Phangan 🇹🇭</li>
          <li>The One Hostel, Hanoi 🇻🇳</li>
          <li>Vietnam Latin Experience, Hanoi 🇻🇳</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <!-- <div class="">
        <div class="card highlight-card">
          <h3>Opened For</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Karan Kanchan</li>
            <li>Dev Jani</li>
            <li>The Yellow Diary</li>
            <li>SuReal</li>
            <li>Abhishek Mantri</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div> -->
    </div>

    <p class="closing-note">
      After my set, you'll usually find me at the bar, pretending to understand
      wine and oversharing.
    </p>
    <CTA title="Book Your Next Event" />
  </div>
</PageLayout>
